  "selector": { "action_name": "<worst action_name>", "action_timestamp": "<action_timestamp>" },
  "title": "Action waterfall — <worst action_name>" }
```
Emit exactly one such chart. If no flagged/row-level data exists at all, skip it.

### Step 4 — Return JSON
Return this exact structure in a ```json code block:
{
  "agent": "root-cause-agent",
  "status": "CONFIRMED",
  "total_actions": null,
  "total_flagged": { "actions": null, "pct": null },
  "types_explained": null,
  "root_causes": [
    { "type_key": "...", "type_label": "...", "nature": "performance",
